# Bag End — the repo holds method, never numbers (AGENTS.md §4).
# Session scratch and owner-refreshed snapshots (may contain figures):
private/
.scratch/
*.snapshot
*.snapshot.*

# Numeric-file guards — data exports are never committed anywhere in the tree:
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.qif
*.ofx
*.qfx

# OS / editor / tooling cruft:
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
